--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bc3cb1b1c1fbdfb42b12a08b6413be21, type: 3}
  m_Name: MerchantConversation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DungeonGame.Dialogue.DialogueConversation
  entryNode: greeting
  nodes:
  - id: greeting
    text: Welcome, traveller. Steel, supplies, or a story for the road? Take your
      time - the dungeon will not wait for either of us.
    responses:
    - text: Trade
      nextNode: 
      action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 34a687656b2269e4ba70fb6d47ef1dc4, type: 2}
    - text: Ask About Wares
      nextNode: wares
      action: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Ask About Rumors
      nextNode: rumors
      action: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Goodbye
      nextNode: 
      action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b04bc50ce9793c045abd69ada89442c3, type: 2}
  - id: wares
    text: A sturdy wooden shield, an iron sword, and a potion for when courage runs
      thin. Simple tools, honestly sold. Have a look before you head below.
    responses:
    - text: Let me see your wares.
      nextNode: 
      action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 34a687656b2269e4ba70fb6d47ef1dc4, type: 2}
    - text: Something else...
      nextNode: greeting
      action: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Goodbye
      nextNode: 
      action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b04bc50ce9793c045abd69ada89442c3, type: 2}
  - id: rumors
    text: They say the lower halls remember every adventurer who never came back.
      I say bring a shield, watch the corners, and never trust a quiet doorway.
    responses:
    - text: Back to business.
      nextNode: greeting
      action: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Goodbye
      nextNode: 
      action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b04bc50ce9793c045abd69ada89442c3, type: 2}
